{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"strong"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"readonly"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite\/DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfiguration","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@DotFaceLite@objc(cs)DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"simple"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite\/DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets\/simple","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite","doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite\/DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets"]]},"metadata":{"title":"simple","fragments":[{"text":"simple","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Property","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"c:@M@DotFaceLite@objc(cs)DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets(cpy)simple","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"DotFaceLite"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"simple"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuration suitable for face verification use cases."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The component operates without any visual aids or guidance for the user, with the exception of the detection layer (tracking circle)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"There is no automatic triggering of the capture process."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Instead, the client is responsible for initiating the capture by explicitly calling the "},{"type":"text","text":"requestCapture"},{"type":"text","text":" method."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This configuration provides a minimalistic approach, offering flexibility to the client in managing the capture timing and user interaction,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is often desired in verification scenarios."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/dotfacelite\/dotflfaceautocaptureconfigurationpresets\/simple"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"references":{"doc://DotFaceLite/documentation/DotFaceLite":{"url":"\/documentation\/dotfacelite","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite","title":"DotFaceLite","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"version: 9.6.0"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://DotFaceLite/documentation/DotFaceLite/DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfiguration":{"url":"\/documentation\/dotfacelite\/dotflfaceautocaptureconfiguration","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite\/DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfiguration","title":"DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuration options for the UI Face Auto Capture component."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://DotFaceLite/documentation/DotFaceLite/DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets":{"url":"\/documentation\/dotfacelite\/dotflfaceautocaptureconfigurationpresets","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite\/DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets","title":"DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pre-defined sets of configurations."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://DotFaceLite/documentation/DotFaceLite/DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets/simple":{"type":"topic","title":"simple","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"simple"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceLite\/documentation\/DotFaceLite\/DOTFLFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets\/simple","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/dotfacelite\/dotflfaceautocaptureconfigurationpresets\/simple","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuration suitable for face verification use cases."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The component operates without any visual aids or guidance for the user, with the exception of the detection layer (tracking circle)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"There is no automatic triggering of the capture process."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Instead, the client is responsible for initiating the capture by explicitly calling the "},{"type":"text","text":"requestCapture"},{"type":"text","text":" method."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This configuration provides a minimalistic approach, offering flexibility to the client in managing the capture timing and user interaction,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is often desired in verification scenarios."}]}}}